NAMD_MLFF_EXTRA_LIBS  (custom-op libraries)
  export NAMD_MLFF_EXTRA_LIBS=/abs/libA.so:/abs/libB.so      # dependencies first
  Each is dlopen'd RTLD_NOW|RTLD_GLOBAL in order before torch::jit::load, in mlff_load (the only load path in the dlopen shim).
  Failure -> mlff_load fails with "NAMD_MLFF_EXTRA_LIBS: dlopen(<path>) failed: <dlerror>" (NAMD prints it and stops).
  Also exported to the mlff_shim_test (reads the same env var). bench_common.py has the matching --extra-lib.
